        "original_id": "4449c5c6-7c5e-5b5f-9a82-441af9ca49d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Duke, Channing Tatum\n- Companies: Hasbro\n- Products: G.I. Joe toyline, G.I. Joe Hall of Fame 12-inch action figures, Target Exclusive Duke\n- Works: Coach Carter, G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra, G.I. Joe: Retaliation, G.I. Joe comic books, G.I. Joe cartoon series\n- Topics: fictional characters, film portrayals\n\nFacts:\n- In 1991, Hasbro began the G.I. Joe Hall of Fame era of 12-inch action figures by releasing the Target Exclusive Duke for nostalgic collectors of vintage G.I. Joe figures.\n- On April 26, 1980, Channing Matthew Tatum was born, and he is an American actor.\n- In 2005, Channing Tatum made his film debut in the drama film Coach Carter.\n- In 2009, Channing Tatum portrayed Duke in the live-action film G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra.\n- In 2013, Channing Tatum portrayed Duke again in the sequel G.I. Joe: Retaliation.\n- Duke is a fictional character from the G.I. Joe toyline, comic books, and cartoon series.",
